  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Oat and pecan scones fold "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "rolled oats",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "rolled-oats"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " into a standard dough for a heartier texture and a nutty finish. The oats absorb liquid during mixing, so the dough will feel stiffer than a plain scone. Do not add extra milk to loosen it, or the scones will spread flat rather than rise."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
